OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThere will be a few light
OL,6,Fshowers around at first, mainly for
OL,7,FCaithness. Otherwise it will be a dry
OL,8,Fday with sunny spells and light winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FA dry evening with clear
OL,11,Fspells. Staying dry in the east
OL,12,Fovernight but clouding over in the
OL,13,Fwest with patchy rain possible towards
OL,14,FSkye and Eilean Siar.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FRather cloudy through the day
OL,17,Fwith outbreaks of patchy light
OL,18,Frain.Feeling warm in the best of the
OL,19,Fbrightness towards Inverness and
OL,20,FNairn. Rain turning heavier in the
OL,21,Fevening. Occasionally windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
